@@ -83,6 +83,37 @@ In addition to these rule sets, you will also find a number of rule sets related
 
 Since an rstheme is just CSS, anything that you can do with CSS you can do in an rstheme.
 
+### Pane headers and toolbars
+
+The following `rstheme_` classes identify pane surfaces without depending on
+GWT-generated class names or the order of children in the DOM:
+
+| Class | Surface |
+| --- | --- |
+| `.rstheme_primaryWindowFrameHeader` | The title strip used by primary windows, including the Console when shown without tabs. |
+| `.rstheme_toolbar` | The table containing a toolbar's controls, inside `.rstheme_toolbarWrapper`. |
+| `.rstheme_windowFrameHeader` | The layout container holding a pane's header, including tabbed headers. |
+| `.rstheme_windowFrameContent` | The layout container holding a pane's main or full-size content. |
+
+These classes are added alongside the built-in styles. They do not change the
+default appearance. For example, add this to a dark rstheme to recolor the
+header and toolbar surfaces in Modern or Sky:
+
+```css
+.rstudio-themes-flat .rstheme_primaryWindowFrameHeader,
+.rstudio-themes-flat .rstheme_toolbar,
+.rstudio-themes-flat .rstheme_windowFrameHeader,
+.rstudio-themes-flat .rstheme_windowFrameContent {
+  background-color: #242421 !important;
+  border-color: #4a453c !important;
+}
+```
+
+Keep overrides to colors and borders. Changing sizes, positioning, overflow,
+pointer events, or focus styles can hide controls or interfere with resizing
+and keyboard navigation. These hooks do not style the operating system's
+title bar or the contents of embedded frames, such as Posit Assistant.
+
 ## Testing changes to a theme
 
 If you're modifying a theme which has already been added to RStudio, you may need to restart RStudio desktop in order to make the changes take effect.
